{
  "_provenance": [
    "Minnippi is NOT in OSM as a golf course (only a cartpath + ponds), so geometry was triangulated from OPEN data only:",
    "- greens: centroids traced from Esri World Imagery (mean-shift over the green-turf mask, smoothness-weighted to lock the putting surface). Verified hole-by-hole against the aerial.",
    "- tees: back-tee boxes traced the same way; per-hole straight tee->green lengths cross-checked against par (all sensible).",
    "- par/SI: public scorecard facts (front nine odd SIs / back nine even). par 72.",
    "- cr/slope 73.1/123: public rated (back) tee (golfpass/planetgolf).",
    "- water: OSM ponds way 611986696 + 668007566 (natural=water), re-tagged golf=lateral_water_hazard for the build input.",
    "- HOLE 8 green is a flagged estimate: it is tree-framed and could not be pinned as tightly as the others; confirm on-course via the Set-tee tool.",
    "Build: node scripts/play/gap-fill.mjs <osm-ponds.json> minnippi-golf-and-range.config.json -> bake-play-course.mjs"
